From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:51:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] timerdclient: include time declaration

Modern C++ toolchains no longer provide the declaration of time() through
unrelated headers. Include the standard C time header explicitly.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 lib/timerdclient/timerdclient.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/lib/timerdclient/timerdclient.cpp b/lib/timerdclient/timerdclient.cpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/lib/timerdclient/timerdclient.cpp
+++ b/lib/timerdclient/timerdclient.cpp
@@ -25,2 +25,3 @@
 #include <string.h>
+#include <time.h>
 
